ing the mystique of a poetic singer-songwriter. 'Searching for Sugar Man' echoes this approach in portraying Rodriguez's enigmatic persona and profound lyrical impact.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw382","target":"aw385","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"An iconic rock documentary known for its raw portrayal of musicians and the cultural impact of their music. 'Searching for Sugar Man' shares a similar spirit of capturing the authentic energy and widespread influence of a musical artist, albeit with a different narrative focus.","direction":"outgoing"}],"lineage":{"influenced_by":["aw382","aw382","aw382","aw382","aw382"],"influences":[]},"stats":{"total_connected":5,"influences_count":3,"influenced_count":2,"filter":"all","vault_count":0,"beyond_count":5}}